<title>ROMANIA: Tremor rocks eastern Romania, no damage reported.</title>
<headline>Tremor rocks eastern Romania, no damage reported.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake measuring 3.8 on the open-ended Richter scale shook Romania's eastern Vrancea region on Tuesday, the country's Earth Physics Institute said.</p>
<p>It said the tremor, which struck at 1441 (1141 GMT) at a depth of 140 km was felt slightly but there were no reports of damage.</p>
